@attribute [Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization.AllowAnonymous]
@page "/backend-decision"
<PageTitle>Backend decision — nergal</PageTitle>
<main>
    <h1>Native nftables first</h1>
    <p>nergal will preserve explicit source NAT, original-connection matching, per-source meters, bridge policy, and atomic scoped updates.</p>
    <p>Firewalld is not an implemented backend. A future adapter must pass the same conformance tests before accepting a policy.</p>
    <p>This web foundation is read-only. A separate library compiles a small input-filter policy slice; it is not connected to this page. Local administrator sessions can be enabled separately.</p>
    <a href="/">Back to nergal</a>
</main>
